== Effect ==
* Spawns a [[familiar]] which spawns friendly [[blue flies]] in a room with monsters when Isaac holds down a fire key.
** The initial blue fly will target a monster once nearby, in which Rotten Baby will lock its blue flies automatically onto the same one, immediately heading towards and damaging it until it dies.
* {{transformation contribution|Conjoined}}

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|r}} This item can rarely drop from destroying [[Rocks#Polyps|polyps]] in {{s|Corpse}}.{{dlc-}}
* Spawns one Fly at a time.
* Blue Flies deal 2x Isaac's damage.
* Flies will be generated regardless of Isaac's ability to fire tears normally.
* {{dlc|r}} [[Familiar]]s that follow behind Isaac have a certain priority in how close their position is to him over other familiars, with Rotten Baby having the lowest priority at {{dlc|nr+}} 6th / {{dlc|r+}} 8th and thus being farther from Isaac than familiars of different priorities.

== Synergies ==
* {{T|Fish Tail}}: Rotten Baby will spawn two flies at a time.
* {{i|Mongo Baby}}: Mongo Baby will also spawn flies.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|BFFS!}}: Rotten Baby becomes larger, but this is only a cosmetic change.
* {{I|Hive Mind}}: Fly damage is doubled.
* {{T|The Twins}}: Unlimited flies can be slowly generated by walking back and forth between rooms while firing.  A new fly will generate each time Rotten Baby is duplicated.

